  "_comment": [
    "Region pack definitions for the FLCKD tile service.",
    "Generated from https://download.geofabrik.de/index-v1-nogeom.json on 2026-08-30.",
    "Boundaries come from Geofabrik .poly files - we do NOT hand-write bounding boxes.",
    "Puerto Rico and the U.S. Virgin Islands are deliberately absent: parent_pbf does not",
    "cover them, so no pack can be cut from it. Do not re-add them without a build that",
    "sources them separately, or every release will report them as failures.",
    "source_pbf_bytes_observed is INFORMATIONAL ONLY (sizing/planning). It is not used by the build.",
    "Pack granularity is a whole Valhalla tile (level 0 = 4 deg, 1 = 1 deg, 2 = 0.25 deg),",
    "so adjacent packs overlap slightly at their borders. That is intentional: it keeps",
    "routing continuous across a state line for a user who only downloaded one side."
